### List all routes (public, unfiltered)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/routes

###

### List only the logged-in user's routes (log in first via auth_tests.http)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/routes/mine

###

### Get a specific route by id
GET http://localhost:3001/api/routes/1

###

### Compute directions between two points (path + distance + duration + elevation + safety score)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/routes/directions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start": { "lat": 49.2827, "lon": -123.1207 },
  "end": { "lat": 49.2820, "lon": -123.1150 }
}

###

### Create a new route
POST http://localhost:3001/api/routes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_name": "Science World",
  "start_latitude": 49.273468,
  "start_longitude": -123.102911,
  "destination_name": "BC Place",
  "destination_latitude": 49.276721,
  "destination_longitude": -123.112381,
  "elevation": 42,
  "distance": 918.1,
  "duration": 207.5,
  "safety_score": 90,
  "created_by": 1
}

###

### Delete a route by id (own route unless logged in as admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/routes/1
